{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15975","headline":"当窗织 · 王建","name":"当窗织","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"叹息复叹息，园中有枣行人食。\n贫家女爲富家织，翁母隔墙不得力。\n水寒手澁丝脆断，续来续去心肠烂。\n草虫促促机下啼，两日催成一匹半。\n输官上顶有零落，姑未得衣身不着。\n当窗却羡青楼倡，十指不动衣盈箱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15975.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15975","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}